{%- comment -%}
Local override of the al_folio_core selected_papers.liquid.

Adds the author-role legend above the short list, so the dagger and the
asterisk on the About page are explained without visiting /publications/.
The styles are inlined because selected_papers is rendered by the about
layout, which does not inject `page._styles`.
{%- endcomment -%}
<p style="margin: -.2rem 0 1.1rem; padding: .5rem .85rem; background: #f7f7f7; border-radius: 6px; font-size: .8rem; color: #5a5a5a;">
<sup style="color: #8a1c1c; font-weight: 700;">*</sup> Corresponding author &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; <span style="text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-color: #8a6bb5; text-underline-offset: 2px;">Students / RAs under my supervision</span> &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; <b>Bold</b> = me
</p>
<div class="publications">
{% bibliography --group_by none --query @*[selected=true]* %}
</div>
